> specified in README.md's "Open decisions"/"Open research" sections.

**Changes:**
- Before writing any code, verified every URL this module would hardcode
  against the live services (not assumed from the v1 README, which was
  explicitly flagged as unconfirmed): confirmed OT 26.06's
  `ftp.ebi.ac.uk`/`ftp://` and `https://` directory listings for
  `target/`, `association_by_datasource_indirect/`, and `disease/`;
  confirmed Reactome numbered-release URLs *do* exist
  (`https://download.reactome.org/97/...`), resolving one of README.md's
  open research questions; downloaded and byte-diffed
  `Ensembl2Reactome.txt` against `Ensembl2Reactome_PE_All_Levels.txt` to
  confirm the former is not PE-level (the exact `GRB2-1` bug class) —
  discovered it's ENSG/ENSP/ENST-mixed for human, not uniformly ENSG;
  downloaded and cross-tabulated the real FI file
  (`FIsInGene_04142025_with_annotations.txt`, 272,622 rows) to recover its
