  MONDO-primary, not EFO-primary (README.md's own `EFO_0005755` worked
  example isn't a primary id in 26.06 at all).
- Created `ingest.py`: a pinned-registry acquisition layer (sha256+size for
  the four small single files; a runtime-discovered local lockfile for the
  two multi-GB Spark-partitioned OT directories, since their part-file UUIDs
